   "value": "Approval prompts offer Allow once, Always allow (can save a matching rule) and Deny. Execution on Local Computer defaults to per-command approval, per desktop. A Team Bot asks for approval only in its owner's own chat; in other chats it works within the permissions its owner set up.",
