    "E-grok-bot-00049"
   ],
   "value": "A Bot runs commands on your local computer only under the local execution policy: per-command approval by default, settable to always allow, ask every time, or never. A team admin can cap the setting; under a stricter ceiling, Always allow is unavailable.",
   "limitation": "This policy covers commands on your local computer and is separate from the approvals that govern work on the cloud computer."
  },
